# Governance Documents

## Purpose

> **Scope:** Index of the repository-governance documents under `docs/`
> **Key items:** which document owns each rule

| Document          | Owns                                                        |
|-------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------|
| `STYLE.md`        | Prose, tables, headings, and encoding for shipped documents |
| `VERSIONING.md`   | Version format, bump rules, release anchoring               |
| `MAINTENANCE.md`  | Directory roles, file naming, registration, validation      |
| `CONTRIBUTING.md` | Issue reporting, development setup, pull-request rules      |
| `SECURITY.md`     | Vulnerability reporting and trust boundaries                |

Keep each rule in its owning document and link to it instead of duplicating it.
